{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/938938-101-homebrew-additions-to-existing-endowment-ideas","id":938938,"title":"101 Homebrew Additions to Existing Endowment Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-28T10:43:58-07:00","id":938938,"title":"101 Homebrew Additions to Existing Endowment Ideas","content":"Since I've looked and I haven't been able to find threads for posting ideas for homebrew additions to existing endowments, even though it's always seemed like something really fun to do (and the corebook even has mechanics for it). <br /> <br /> 1. <b>Adam's Arm (Thaumatech):</b> Prometheans are one of Cheiron's favorite targets. Since they're already patchwork monsters, it's fairly easy to hack of parts of them and stick them on other bodies (for a certain definition of easy). Adam's Arms are any arms removed from a Promethean and grafted to an operative. Typically, this is done only for operatives who have lost arms- Cheiron doesn't have enough of them that it can pass them out like party favors, and even many Field Project agents balk at amputating an entire arm (and that's before they find out that it causes Disquiet in anyone they touch with it).<br /> <br /> 2. <b>The Protobuster (Thaumatech):</b> Only a few of these devices have been constructed, as making one requires the arm of a Demon. Taking and preserving one would require agents to capture a Demon in Demonic Form and force it into a special high energy chamber. While Cheiron scientists maintain that this process should work, it has never actually been done- Cheiron has so far used other means to obtain the arms used to build these devices. The Protobuster consists of a cylinder of arcane technology that is implanted into an agent's arm capable of expelling a blast of concentrated aether from a palm-mounted port. The intense surges of energy generated by this device require the use of four dispersal rods to safely vent- the user must extend the vents before firing, or else sustain damage from the release of energy within her own body. The sound of wailing guitars can be heard when the device has been prepared to fire. <br /> <br /> 3. <b>Nidhogg Rapid Entrenchment Device (Advanced Armory):</b> In Norse mythology, Nidhogg gnawed at the roots of the world tree. Mythology is replete with subterranean horrors, and TFV's Nidhogg is designed to help them pursue these creatures. The RED is a miniaturized tunnel boring machine the size of a large janitor's cart, with an adjustable, high-powered drill bit capable of grinding through almost any material. A system of vents mounted around the drill suck up dust and dirt and expel them behind the user, keeping him from being blinded or disoriented by the material kicked up by the device's operation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T16:09:10-07:00","id":939205,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/938938-101-homebrew-additions-to-existing-endowment-ideas#post938938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 2. <b>The Protobuster (Thaumatech):</b><br /> The sound of wailing guitars can be heard when the device has been prepared to fire.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://blog.priceplow.com/wp-content/uploads/i-see-what-you-did-there.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T18:32:15-07:00","id":939250,"title":"","content":"Aaaaaand I messed up the title of this thread. The problem was, I was having a hard time communicating that it was for homebrew additions to existing endowments, not entirely new ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T18:36:51-07:00","id":939253,"title":"","content":"Some versions of Chinese vampire have weaknesses surrounding certain woods and having things nailed into their acupuncture points. I'm im love with the idea of VALKYRIE (or a Chinese analogue, because I'm sure the Party has someone to deal with supernatural threats) making a quick and dirty wooden shrapnel grenade in the hopes that it'll be lucky enough to hit some of those chakra spots when it goes off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T19:15:52-07:00","id":939276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/938938-101-homebrew-additions-to-existing-endowment-ideas?p=939253#post939253\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some versions of Chinese vampire have weaknesses surrounding certain woods and having things nailed into their acupuncture points. I'm im love with the idea of VALKYRIE (or a Chinese analogue, because I'm sure the Party has someone to deal with supernatural threats) making a quick and dirty wooden shrapnel grenade in the hopes that it'll be lucky enough to hit some of those chakra spots when it goes off.</div> </div> </div> </div>Quick and dirty wooden shrapnel grenade doesn't sound like something that needs to be AA, you'd probably just need some crafts rolls to make one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","ti